{path}

Everything else is copied exactly as it was loaded.

load.export_gone:
The loaded MIDI file was changed, moved or deleted since it was loaded, so it can't be copied. Nothing was saved.

Put it back, or load it again with File → Load MIDI…:
{path}

load.link_missing:
This project's MIDI file isn't where it was:
{path}

Its notes live in that file, so the project needs it. Find it, or go on without it for now (File → Find the Project's MIDI… finds it later).

load.link_changed:
This MIDI file was changed since the project was saved (saved again from another program?):
{path}

Use it as it is now (its tempos and signatures replace the Conductor pane's), find the file as it was, or go on without it for now.

